ing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Bready bready bready.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f0/Bready_bready_bready..png/revision/latest?cb=20210321095349\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Bready bready bready.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f0/Bready_bready_bready..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321095349\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f0/Bready_bready_bready..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321095349 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f0/Bready_bready_bready..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210321095349 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Bready bready bready.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Bready_bready_bready..png\" data-image-name=\"Bready bready bready..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">9</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Gamble\" title=\"Ed Gamble\">Ed Gamble</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Another_spoon.\" title=\"Another spoon.\">Another spoon.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_cuddle.\" title=\"A cuddle.\">A cuddle.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Bready bready bready.</b></i> is the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">Series 9</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 9 October 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Gamble\" title=\"Ed Gamble\">Ed Gamble</a>. This episode featured <a href=\"/wiki/Katherine_Ryan\" title=\"Katherine Ryan\">Katherine Ryan</a>, who stood in place of <a href=\"/wiki/Katy_Wix\" title=\"Katy Wix\">Katy Wix</a> during the studio segments.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_Title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode Title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_Titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate Titles</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_Title\">Episode Title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode Title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Bready_bready_bready.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode Title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Bready bready bready\" was something <a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Brand\" title=\"Jo Brand\">Jo Brand</a> said while defending her attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Push_a_melon_up_the_slide_and_into_the_caravan_with_these_breadsticks\" title=\"Push a melon up the slide and into the caravan with these breadsticks\">Push a melon up the slide and into the caravan with these breadsticks</a> task. The title card shows seven teabags, even though no task use any teabags at any point.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_Titles\">Alternate Titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate Titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Bready_bready_bready.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate Titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Brød, brød, brød', which translates as 'Bread, bread, bread'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Leiviti, leiviti, leiviti', which translates as 'Bready bready bready'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Brød, Brød, Brød', which translates as 'Bread, bread, bread'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Bready_bready_bready.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"t